INSERT INTO `projects` VALUES (1,'test-1','aiinhome','Project test-1 for aiinhome aims to evaluate the current system architecture and identify critical areas for performance enhancement and scalability. Key objectives include optimizing existing workflows and improving data processing efficiency, while audit goals focus on verifying data accuracy, assessing security vulnerabilities, and ensuring compliance with industry best practices.','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-25 05:30:57','2026-07-25 05:32:40','2026-07-26','2026-07-26'),(2,'test by hm','pwc ','good ','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-25 05:48:41','2026-07-25 06:05:57','2026-07-01','2026-10-30'),(3,'test 4','pwc tpr','Project \'test 4\' for PwC TPR focuses on validating the effectiveness of critical internal controls and operational processes. The key objectives are to ensure compliance with relevant regulatory standards and assess the accuracy of reporting, with an audit goal of identifying any vulnerabilities or areas for strategic enhancement.','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-25 07:04:47','2026-07-25 07:07:12','2026-01-25','2026-12-25'),(4,'test 5','pwc ','Project \'test 5\' is designed to comprehensively evaluate PWC\'s existing financial and operational controls. The primary audit goals include verifying data accuracy, ensuring strict adherence to industry regulations, and identifying strategic opportunities for enhanced efficiency and risk reduction.','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-25 07:09:17','2026-07-25 07:10:28','2026-01-25','2026-12-25'),(5,'test 6','aiinhome','Project \'test 6\' for aiinhome is designed to thoroughly evaluate the current system\'s performance and identify critical areas for enhancement. This includes a comprehensive audit focusing on data accuracy, system security compliance, and overall operational efficiency to ensure optimal functionality and reliability.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-25 07:23:28','2026-07-27 04:40:23','2026-01-25','2026-11-25'),(6,'test-7','aiinhome.pvt.ltd','Project test-7 is a structured initiative designed for aiinhome.pvt.ltd to comprehensively evaluate and optimize their current technological infrastructure and operational workflows. The primary objective is to conduct a detailed system audit that identifies performance bottlenecks, security vulnerabilities, and integration inefficiencies. This collaborative assessment will establish a robust foundation for scalable growth and ensure alignment with industry-standard quality assurance protocols.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-25 07:52:07','2026-07-25 11:20:51','2026-07-26','2026-07-29'),(7,'test 8','agro eng','Project test 8 is a collaborative initiative for agro eng focused on evaluating the operational efficiency and technical performance of their agricultural systems. The primary audit goal is to conduct a comprehensive review of existing processes to ensure strict compliance with industry safety standards and environmental regulations. Ultimately, this project aims to provide agro eng with actionable recommendations to optimize resource utilization and mitigate operational risks.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 04:57:50','2026-07-27 05:03:43','2026-01-27','2026-12-27'),(8,'test 8','agro eng','Project test 8 is a collaborative initiative for agro eng focused on evaluating the operational efficiency and technical performance of their agricultural systems. The primary audit goal is to conduct a comprehensive review of existing processes to ensure strict compliance with industry safety standards and environmental regulations. Ultimately, this project aims to provide agro eng with actionable recommendations to optimize resource utilization and mitigate operational risks.','DRAFT',2,'2026-07-27 04:57:51','2026-07-27 04:57:51','2026-01-27','2026-12-27'),(9,'Test-9','Aiinhome','Project Test-9 is a strategic initiative developed for Aiinhome to evaluate and optimize their digital infrastructure and operational workflows. The primary goal of this project is to conduct a comprehensive system audit focused on identifying performance bottlenecks, security vulnerabilities, and compliance alignments. Through these assessments, the project will deliver actionable recommendations to enhance overall system reliability and improve service delivery.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 05:22:44','2026-07-27 05:29:01','2026-05-12','2027-01-13'),(10,'test 10','airtel','airtel pvt ltd','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 06:20:54','2026-07-27 06:26:01','2026-01-27','2026-12-27'),(11,'project 11','tcs','Project 11 aims to evaluate and optimize Tata Consultancy Services\' operational framework to enhance service delivery efficiency and infrastructure reliability. The primary audit goals focus on verifying compliance with global security standards, identifying workflow bottlenecks, and ensuring robust data governance protocols. This initiative will deliver actionable insights to mitigate risk and align TCS\'s processes with industry best practices.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 06:42:27','2026-07-27 06:45:16','2026-01-27','2026-12-27'),(12,'Project 12','google','best','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 12:21:32','2026-07-27 12:23:30','2026-06-27','2026-10-27'),(13,'test 13','pwc','The project test 13 for PwC focuses on conducting a comprehensive audit to evaluate internal control frameworks and operational efficiency. The primary objective is to identify potential risk exposure and provide actionable recommendations to ensure regulatory compliance and process optimization.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 13:35:07','2026-07-27 13:36:07','2026-06-27','2026-10-27'),(14,'test 13','pwc','The project test 13 for PwC focuses on conducting a comprehensive audit to evaluate internal control frameworks and operational efficiency. The primary objective is to identify potential risk exposure and provide actionable recommendations to ensure regulatory compliance and process optimization.','DRAFT',2,'2026-07-27 13:35:08','2026-07-27 13:35:08','2026-06-27','2026-10-27'),(15,'test 15','aivista tech','Project test 15 focuses on conducting a comprehensive technical assessment for Aivista Tech to optimize current system performance and infrastructure stability. The primary objective is to perform a detailed audit of existing workflows to identify security gaps and ensure alignment with industry-standard operational requirements.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 13:59:11','2026-07-27 14:00:48','2026-05-27','2026-07-31'),(16,'Project 16','zomato','Project 16 for Zom focuses on conducting a comprehensive technical audit to evaluate system infrastructure and identify performance optimization opportunities. The primary objective is to enhance operational security and scalability while ensuring full alignment with Zom’s core project requirements.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 14:16:57','2026-07-27 14:18:44','2026-05-27','2026-08-27'),(17,'test 17','tcs','Project test 17 for TCS is designed to evaluate and optimize core operational workflows through a comprehensive systemic review. The primary objective is to conduct a rigorous audit of existing processes to identify efficiency gaps and ensure full alignment with client compliance standards.','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-27 16:46:08','2026-07-27 16:58:31','2026-02-27','2026-09-27'),(18,'TEST  18','AJIO','The TEST 18 project for AJIO focuses on conducting a comprehensive quality assurance audit to evaluate current operational workflows and system performance metrics. The primary objective is to identify critical bottlenecks and deliver actionable insights that optimize platform efficiency and ensure alignment with established project standards.','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-27 17:21:34','2026-07-27 17:22:56','2026-05-27','2026-11-27'),(19,'TEST 19','HCL','Project TEST 19 for HCL aims to evaluate and optimize current operational workflows through a comprehensive systemic review. The primary audit goal is to identify performance bottlenecks and ensure full alignment with established quality standards and project requirements.','DRAFT',2,'2026-07-27 17:57:33','2026-07-27 17:57:33','2026-06-27','2026-08-27'),(20,'TEST 19','HCL','Project TEST 19 for HCL aims to evaluate and optimize current operational workflows through a comprehensive systemic review. The primary audit goal is to identify performance bottlenecks and ensure full alignment with established quality standards and project requirements.','BASELINE_PENDING_REVIEW',2,'2026-07-27 17:57:33','2026-07-27 17:59:10','2026-06-27','2026-08-27'),(21,'TEST  20','CRED','Project TEST 20 aims to conduct a comprehensive security assessment of the CRED infrastructure to identify and mitigate potential vulnerabilities. The primary objective is to enhance system integrity and ensure robust data protection through a rigorous audit of existing protocols and security controls.','ACTIVE',2,'2026-07-27 18:41:45','2026-07-27 18:43:57','2026-05-28','2026-09-28');
